                                <enumeratedValue>
                                    <name>1</name>
                                    <description>When 1 is written, the EDMAC reads the corresponding descriptor and transmits frames where the TD0.TACT bit is 1. The TR bit becomes 0 after all the valid frames are transmitted. </description>
